# ========================================
# PrestaFacture — racine (complète server/ et frontend/)
# ========================================

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Builds
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/build/
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.cache/
**/.vite/

# Tests & couverture
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
**/node_modules/.vite/
**/vitest/results.json

# TypeScript
*.tsbuildinfo

# Variables d'environnement (jamais de secrets)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.env.prod
# Modèles versionnés
!**/env.example
!**/env.prod.example
!**/.env.example
!docs/marketing/env.marketing.example

# Marketing — production pub (PII possible, non versionné)
docs/marketing/screenshots-temp/
docs/marketing/tts-output/
docs/marketing/pub-2026/captures/*
!docs/marketing/pub-2026/captures/.gitkeep
docs/marketing/pub-2026/videos/
docs/marketing/pub-2026/workflow/
docs/marketing/pub-2026/audio/*
!docs/marketing/pub-2026/audio/.gitkeep
docs/marketing/pub-2026/subtitles/*
!docs/marketing/pub-2026/subtitles/.gitkeep
docs/marketing/pub-2026/exports/*
!docs/marketing/pub-2026/exports/.gitkeep
docs/marketing/pub-2026/manifest.json
docs/marketing/pub-2026/.playwright-auth.json

# Logs applicatifs
**/logs/
!**/logs/.gitkeep
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Prisma / SQLite (dev local uniquement)
server/prisma/**/*.db
server/prisma/**/*.db-journal
server/prisma/**/*.db-wal
server/prisma/**/*.db-shm
server/prisma/prisma/

# Exports & binaires locaux
*.pdf
**/tmp/

# Étude recherche noms de domaine (whois) — artefacts générés localement
scripts/whois-*.json
scripts/whois-batch-results.json
docs/rapports/RAPPORT-RECHERCHE-DOMAINES-*.pdf
# Scripts de génération versionnés : scripts/generate-domain-report-pdf.py, whois-batch*.ps1

# Secrets & clés
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
**/secrets.json

# Plaquette commerciale (génération locale, PDF)
docs/plaquette-commerciale/
docs/plaquette-commercial/

# Dossier accréditation PA — pièces sensibles (Kbis, ISO…)
docs/accreditation-pa/annexes/pieces-jointes/*
!docs/accreditation-pa/annexes/pieces-jointes/.gitkeep

# IDE / OS / outils
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.cursor/

# Notes agent locales
AGENT.md
